---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Brief Received | Alturascope Estimating"
  description="Your estimating brief has been received. We'll come back to you the same working day."
  canonical="https://alturascope.com/estimating/thank-you/"
  robots="noindex, follow"
  fullWidth={true}
>
  <section class="bg-navy min-h-[70vh] flex items-center pt-32 pb-24">
    <div class="max-w-[760px] mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="label text-gold mb-4">Brief Received</p>
      <h1 class="text-[2rem] md:text-[2.8rem] font-light text-offwhite leading-tight">
        Got it. We&rsquo;ll come back to you today.
      </h1>
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-offwhite/75 leading-body">
        <p>
          Your brief is with the estimating desk. You&rsquo;ll get a straight yes or no on whether we can hit your return date the same working day &mdash; not a brochure, and not a week from now.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you asked for a non-disclosure agreement, that comes back with the reply and before any drawings change hands.
        </p>
        <p>
          If the deadline is tight enough that waiting on email is a problem, reply to the confirmation you&rsquo;ve just been sent and say so &mdash; we&rsquo;ll call instead.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 border border-gold/40 bg-white/[0.03] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-[1.15rem] font-medium text-gold">While you wait</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-offwhite/70 leading-body text-[0.95rem]">
          Worth two minutes: the <a href="/estimating/basis-of-estimate/" class="text-offwhite border-b border-gold pb-0.5 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">Basis of Estimate standard</a> sets out exactly what will be stated on the pack you get back &mdash; documents priced with revisions, inclusions, exclusions, assumptions and allowances, and where responsibility sits.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-6 text-sm">
        <a href="/estimating/" class="text-offwhite/70 hover:text-offwhite transition-colors">Back to the Estimating Desk &rarr;</a>
        <a href="/services/" class="text-offwhite/70 hover:text-offwhite transition-colors">Site documentation services &rarr;</a>
        <a href="/" class="text-offwhite/70 hover:text-offwhite transition-colors">Home &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
